From c252889a46f41b4c396b89e005ec89836f2524be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitrii Zagorodnov <dmitrii@eucalyptus.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Sep 2013 04:10:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Input validation, shellout hardening on back-end

- validating bucketName and bucketPath in BundleInstance
- validating device name in Attach and DetachVolume
- removed some uses of system() and popen()

Fixes EUCA-7572, EUCA-7520
